---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
import Timeline from '../components/Timeline.astro';
import Socials from '../components/Socials.astro';
import me from '../assets/me.jpeg';
---

<Layout
  title="About — Ashish Gautam"
  description="A bit about Ashish Gautam — software engineer at Apple — and a timeline of how he got here."
>
  <section class="hero hero-with-photo">
    <div class="hero-photo hero-photo-sm">
      <Image src={me} alt="Ashish Gautam" width={130} height={130} loading="eager" />
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">about</p>
      <h1>Where I've been.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        A short version of the long story — the schools, the jobs, and the
        places that have shaped how I build software.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <p>
      I'm a software engineer with around eight years of experience, currently
      at <strong>Apple</strong> in the <em>Applied Machine Learning</em> org in
      Hyderabad. Before Apple, I worked at <strong>Salesforce</strong> on Media
      Cloud, at <strong>Amazon</strong> in the Seller &amp; Fulfillment Tech
      org, and at <strong>Nagarro</strong> on large-scale e-commerce systems.
    </p>
    <p>
      I tend to work on backends — Java, Python, C++, JavaScript on top — and I
      care a lot about the boring infrastructure that holds everything else up.
      Strong foundations in data structures, algorithms, and the kind of
      day-to-day craft that doesn't show up in screenshots.
    </p>
    <p>
      I've lived in <strong>Delhi</strong> most of my life — that's where I grew
      up, studied, and worked through Nagarro, Amazon, and Salesforce. Apple is
      what brought me to <strong>Hyderabad</strong>, where I'm based now.
    </p>
    <p>
      The fastest way to reach me is
      <a href="mailto:ashishgautam2705@gmail.com">email</a>, or via
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ashishgautamdev/">LinkedIn</a>.
    </p>
    <Socials size="sm" />
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Timeline</h2>
    <Timeline />
  </section>
</Layout>
